      <div class="row">
        <div class="col">

          <!-- Header -->
          <div class="header bg-cover" style="background-image: url(/assets/img/15.jpg);"></div>

        </div>
      </div> <!-- / .row -->
    </div> <!-- / .container -->

  </section>

  <!-- ABOUT
    ================================================== -->
  <section class="section pb-0">

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-2">

          <!-- Title -->
          <h6 class="title">
            Distinctive Benefits
          </h6>

        </div>
        <div class="col-md-10">

          <!-- Heading -->
          <h3 class="mb-4">
            The boutique nature of Donaldson Attorneys Inc. means that clients always feel exclusive and important.
            Combined with our exceptional success rate and team of specialists, we manage to consistently impress our
            clients and achieve the results they desire.
          </h3>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-2">

          <!-- Title -->
          <h6 class="title">
            OUR HISTORY
          </h6>

        </div>
        <div class="col-md-10">

          <!-- No Heading -->
          <p class="text-muted mb-5">
            Our founding partner, Mr. Donaldson established Donaldson Attorneys in late 2020 after many years of working
            as first an attorney, and later an Advocate, in both private practice and various corporate positions.
            Despite our relatively short existence, we have already grown to such an extent that only two months after
            commencing trading, we already needed to appoint another attorney to assist with our rapidly expanding
            business. With our highly driven team and the mentorship of Mr. Donaldson, we expect to become one of the
            leading law firms in the country within the next 10 years.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>

        </div>

      </div>


