      </div>
      <div class="col-md-10">

        <!-- Heading -->
        <h3 class="mb-4">
          We currently employ four attorneys and whilst we cover a broad spectrum of legal
          fields, our particular specialities are Criminal Law, Labour Law, Family Law, Debt Collection and Commercial
